%N A398614 Decimal expansion of the height of a canonical (dual-uniform) 9-gonal trapezohedron with unit short edge length.
%C A398614 The 9-gonal trapezohedron is the dual polyhedron of the 9-gonal antiprism.
%H A398614 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A398614/b398614.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 2..10000</a>
